                  "article": {
                    "body": "The Moon’s nakshatra at birth sets both the starting dasha lord and how much of that period remains. Divide the Moon’s position within the nakshatra to find the elapsed and balance portions.\n\nOnce the balance is found, the dasha sequence proceeds in the fixed Vimshottari order regardless of chart specifics."
