            "title": "The Nine Planets",
            "summary": "What each graha signifies.",
            "objective": "By the end of this chapter, learners can name what each planet governs.",
            "status": "published",
            "lessons": [
              {
                "id": "cmudqd8eg001vmmgzl6ymelfw",
