                "title": "Reading the houses",
                "type": "reading",
                "durationMin": 15,
                "status": "published",
                "updatedAt": "2026-09-23T10:41:37.498Z",
                "objectives": [],
                "content": {
                  "article": {
                    "body": "Each of the twelve houses governs a department of life, from the first house of self to the twelfth house of loss and release. A planet’s house placement shapes which department it most strongly colours.\n\nKendras (1, 4, 7, 10) anchor the chart’s structure; trikonas (1, 5, 9) carry fortune and dharma; dusthanas (6, 8, 12) bring struggle that can still mature into strength."
                  }
                },
                "settings": {}
              },
